abstract: >-
  Conference abstract (TIMA/FIMA Scientific Convention 2026) proposing Trustworthy Premarital
  Health Education (T-PHE) as primary prevention infrastructure. Practitioner-led, document-informed
  conceptual synthesis; programme theory with six safeguards, a pre-specified failure criterion and
  outcome domains for prospective testing. No effectiveness testing undertaken.
